<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="S5.T3.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">User study.<span id="S5.T3.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Evaluated by human and VLM evaluators, we report the percentage of samples where Ours is preferred over baselines. A preference <math id="S5.T3.m62" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;50\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo mathsize="1.110em">%</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;50\%</annotation></semantics></math> indicates Ours outperforming baselines.
</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
