<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F7.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 7</span>: </span><span id="S5.F7.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="S5.F7.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Weather Editing with Multiple Effects.</span>
Our method allows sequential application and combination of multiple effects.
From left to right, we control the weather effect strengths and simulate how weather changes during rainy/snowy days.
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
